-how do we link css to this html?
Inside your <head> section (right below <title>), type a <link> tag with two attributes:

rel="stylesheet" — tells the browser that this linked file is a stylesheet (not an icon or font).

href="styles.css" — gives the relative path to your CSS file in the same folder as index.html.

shorthand just type link and press enter. 



