           BODY
Think of <body> as the visible stage of your page. Before filling in details, we lay out the three big structural zones so your document has a clear spine:

<header> — Top area for your brand/name and navigation.

<main> — The centerpiece of the page where your portfolio sections live.

<footer> — Bottom area for contact info and closing links.

